flowchart LR
    START[Planner: audit richiesto] --> PREFLIGHT[Preflight + root]
    PREFLIGHT --> MODE[Rileva backend-only / frontend-only / full-stack]
    MODE --> PREVIOUS[Indice report precedenti]
    PREVIOUS --> EVIDENCE[Evidence pack bounded]
    EVIDENCE --> PERF[Performance + architettura]
    PERF --> API[Backend + API + dati]
    API --> UX[Frontend + UX se applicabile]
    UX --> PRODUCT[Feature + prodotto + agent UX]
    PRODUCT --> TEST[Micro-validazioni read-only]
    TEST --> SCORE[Score /10 + confidenza /10 + dedup]
    SCORE --> REPORT[Report persistito con complete]
    REPORT --> PLANNER[Handoff al Planner]
    PLANNER --> ROUTE[Planner decide e assegna]

    RULES[Schietto | nessuna invenzione | FACT/INFERENCE/HYPOTHESIS] -.-> SCORE
    CHECK[Checkpoint obbligatorio a ogni fase] -.-> EVIDENCE
